1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 6. CATARINA3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA (BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1628, and 
2 CONT *died in Parras, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married (1) CAPTAIN LORENZO GARCIA-GUTIERREZ. 
2 CONT **He died in Parras, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married (2) FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-TREVINO-SALAZAR June 19, 1648 in Parras, Coahuila, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of JACINTO DE COBARRUBIAS and ANA DE SALAZAR-TREVINO. He was born Abt. 1625.
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for CATARINA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA and FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-TREVINO-SALAZAR: Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. (page 76).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of CATARINA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA and LORENZO GARCIA-GUTIERREZ are:
2 CONT *1. i. JOSE4 GARCIA-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **m. MARIA ELIZONDO-GONZALEZ.
2 CONT *2. ii. MARIA-INEZ GARCIA-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **m. DIEGO BOTELLO.
2 CONT *3. iii. LUCIA GARCIA-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **m. MATEO GARCIA.
2 CONT *4. iv. SANTIAGO GARCIA-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **m. LEONOR DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA.
2 CONT *5. v. BEATRIZ GARCIA-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **b. 1628, Parras, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Aft. October 28, 1694; 
2 CONT **m. (1) JUAN DE TREVINO; 
2 CONT **m. (2) SERGEANT MAJOR JOSE DE TREVINO, Aft. June 19, 1648, Parras, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***d. December 24, 1673, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of CATARINA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA and FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-TREVINO-SALAZAR are:
2 CONT *1. 14. vi. LUCIA4 DE TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **b. Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. 15. vii. BEATRIZ TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY.
2 CONT *3. 16. viii. INES DE TREVINO.
2 CONT *4. 17. ix. SANTIAGO DE TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **b. 1660, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. 18. x. CAPTAIN JOSEPH TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
