2 CONC he Olivares-Espinosa-Aguirre Expedition of 1709. On April 1722, he was appointed Captain of the Presidio as San Antonio de Bexar, being relieved of the command in 1725, was father of Gertrudis, who married Diego Ramon. Source:With
2 CONC  the Makers of San Anonio, by Frederick C. Chabot.
