1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1. CAPTAIN DIEGO3 DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS (DIEGO2 DE VILLARREAL, FRANCISCO1 VILLARREAL) was born 1640. He married (1) INES DE RENTERIA, daughter of JACINTO GARCIA-DE-SEPULVEDA and CLARA FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO. He m
2 CONC arried (2) MARIA-ISABEL DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA Abt. 1665, daughter of FRANCISCO DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO and JUANA GUTIERREZ-DE-LARA-GARCIA. She was born 1642 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (3) MARIA-TOMASINA FLORES-DE
2 CONC -ABREGO December 25, 1675 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of PEDRO FLORES-DE-ABREGO and MARGARITA DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO. She was born 1657, and died April 13, 1680 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon
2 CONC , Mexico. He married (4) MARIANA CORTINAS-DE-ALCORTA January 23, 1688/89 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of ANTONIO CORTINAS-DE-ALCORTA and ISABEL MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO. She was born 1642.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of DIEGO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS and INES DE RENTERIA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. JOSEFA FLORES4 VILLARREAL-RENTERIA, m. ANTONIO DE VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. ii. TOMASINA DE VILLARREAL-Y-RENTERIA, b. Abt. 1660, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. iii. CLARA DE RENTERIA, b. 1667, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. ANTONIA VILLARREAL-RENTERIA, b. April 20, 1671, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. v. FRANCISCO DE VILLARREAL-RENTERIA, b. 1677.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. MARGARITA DE RENTERIA-Y-VILLARREAL, b. 1680, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. CAPTAIN ANTONIO LEAL-DE-LEON, June 12, 1692, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1645, Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN ANTONIO LEAL-DE-LEON:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 31.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mil Familias III by Rodolfo de la Garza, page 118.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of DIEGO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS and MARIA-ISABEL DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. vii. BEATRIZ4 DE VILLARREAL, b. 1668, Valle de las Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. September 28, 1719, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. viii. JOSEPH VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1668, Valle de las Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of DIEGO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS and MARIA-TOMASINA FLORES-DE-ABREGO are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. ix. CLARA RENTERIA4 VILLARREAL-FLORES.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. x. THOMASINA DE VILLARREAL-FLORES, b. 1680, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. xi. FRANCISCO-ANDRES DE VILLARREAL-FLORES, b. 1681.
2 CONT
2 CONT xii. ANTONIA VILLARREAL-FLORES, b. April 20, 1691.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of DIEGO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS and MARIANA CORTINAS-DE-ALCORTA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. xiii. JOSE4 DE VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT xiv. NICOLAS DE VILLARREAL, b. January 24, 1689/90, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
