1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 23. FRANCISCO3 BAEZ-DE-TREVINO-SALAZAR (ANA2 DE SALAZAR-TREVINO, PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR) 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1625. 
2 CONT *He married CATARINA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA 19 Jun 1648 in Parras, Coahuila, Mexico4, 
2 CONT **daughter of BERNARDO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY and MARIA-INES DE-LA-CERDA-Y-CASTRO. She was born Abt. 1628, and died in Parras, Coahuila,Mexico.
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-TREVINO-SALAZAR and CATARINA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA: Marriage source:Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. (page 76).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-TREVINO-SALAZAR and CATARINA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA are:
2 CONT *1. 113. i. LUCIA4 DE TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **b. 1656, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. 1694. 
2 CONT *2. 114. ii. BEATRIZ TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY. 
2 CONT *3. 115. iii. INES DE TREVINO. 
2 CONT *4. 116. iv. CAPTAIN SANTIAGO DE TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **b. 1660, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *5. 117. v. CAPTAIN JOSEPH TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, 
2 CONT **b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT
