1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 115. INES4 DE TREVINO (FRANCISCO3 BAEZ-DE-TREVINO-SALAZAR, ANA2 DE SALAZAR-TREVINO, PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR) She married DIEGO BOTELLO-DE-LA-GARZA, son of FRANCISCO BOTELLO-DE-MORALES and JUANA DE-LA-GARZA-MARTINEZ-GUAJA
2 CONC RDO. He was born Abt. 1648 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
