1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 5. CAPTAIN BERNARDO3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA (BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) died October 25, 1676 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. He married JUANA DE CEPEDA-DE-LA-FUENTE in Saltillo, Coahulia, M
2 CONC exico, daughter of AMBROCIO DE CEPEDA-CABALLERO and JUANA DE-LA-FUENTE-MARTINEZ. She died in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN BERNARDO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA:
2 CONT
2 CONT On October 23, 1676, he signed his last will and testament.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 77 & 132.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JUANA DE CEPEDA-DE-LA-FUENTE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. (page 132).
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for BERNARDO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA and JUANA DE CEPEDA-DE-LA-FUENTE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. (page 77).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of BERNARDO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-CERDA and JUANA DE CEPEDA-DE-LA-FUENTE are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. BERNARDO4 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-CEPEDA, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. JUAN DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-CEPEDA, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 12. iii. DIEGO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-Y-CEPEDA, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; d. Aft. May 09, 1733.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. PEDRO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-CEPEDA, b. 1653, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 13. v. JUANA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-CEPEDA, b. 1666
