2 CONT * 			a.	Maria RODRIGUEZ MONTEMAYOR m. 21 Jun 1689, in Monterrey, N.L., Mex, Antonio LOPEZ PRIETO, (son of Nicolas LOPEZ PRIETO and Maria AYALA OVALLE). 
2 CONT * 			b.	Juan RODRIGUEZ MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GARZA m. 21 Oct 1691, in Monterrey, N.L., Mex, Antonia GALVAN BOTELLO, (daughter of Diego GALVAN and Petronila BOTELLO DE-LA-GARZA). 
