1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 219. MARGARITA5 DE CEPEDA-HERRERA (ALONSO4 DE CEPEDA-DE-LA-FUENTE, JUANA3 DE-LA-FUENTE-MARTINEZ, FRANCISCA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ, JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) 
2 CONT *was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN MIGUEL FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, 
2 CONT **son of DIEGO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR and MARIA GUILLEN-DE-ABREGO-GONZALEZ. He was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARGARITA DE CEPEDA-HERRERA and MIGUEL FLORES-DE-VALDEZ are:
2 CONT *1. i. FATHER ANTONIO6 FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, 
2 CONT **b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for FATHER ANTONIO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ: Roman Catholic Priest. 
2 CONT ***Source: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 67.
2 CONT *2. ii. GREGORIO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ.
2 CONT *3. iii. YLDEFONSO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, 
2 CONT **b. Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (1) TEODORA DE-LA-PAZ; 
2 CONT ***d. Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (2) LEONOR DEL VALLE, January 06, 1724/25, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for YLDEFONSO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ and LEONOR DEL VALLE: Index to the Marriage Investigation of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 242.
2 CONT *4. iv. JOSEPH FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1674; 
2 CONT **m. (1) MARIA-FRANCISCA-JAVIERA DE ARISPE; 
2 CONT **m. (2) MARIA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-GUAJARDO, September 30, 1704, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. v. CAPTAIN MIGUEL FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1675, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. ANTONIA DE ARISPE-CUELLAR, February 01, 1691/92, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1674, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for Captain MIGUEL FLORES-DE-VALDEZ and ANTONIA DE ARISPE-CUELLAR: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 28.
2 CONT ****LDS Film #0167978.
2 CONT *6. vi. CAPTAIN JUAN FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-CEPEDA, 
2 CONT **b. 1685, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (1) FRANCISCA-JAVIERA DE ABREGO; 
2 CONT ***b. 1687; 
2 CONT **m. (2) ANA-MARIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO, August 20, 1714, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for JUAN FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-CEPEDA and ANA-MARIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 70.
2 CONT *7. vii. CAPTAIN NICOLAS FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1695, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. JOSEFA DE ARISPE-CUELLAR, July 26, 1714, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1697, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for NICOLAS FLORES-DE-VALDEZ and JOSEFA DE ARISPE-CUELLAR: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 56.
2 CONT *8. viii. MATHIAS FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, 
2 CONT **b. February 20, 1695/96, Sagrario Metropolitano, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
