1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 7. ALFEREZ MARCOS3 FLORES-DE-ABREGO-DE-LA-GARZA (PEDRO2 FLORES-DE-ABREGO, PEDRO1) 
2 CONT *was born 1663 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married ANA DE AYALA-OVALLE December 27, 1681 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of DIEGO DE AYALA-TREVINO and ANA DE OVALLE-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ. 
2 CONT **She was born Abt. 1663 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *Notes for ALFEREZ MARCOS FLORES-DE-ABREGO-DE-LA-GARZA: A.K.A. Marcos Flores de la Garza.
2 CONT **Notes for ANA DE AYALA-OVALLE: A,K,A, Ana de Valle
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for MARCOS FLORES-DE-ABREGO-DE-LA-GARZA and ANA DE AYALA-OVALLE: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 49 [9-22].
2 CONT
