2 CONT *1. 21. i. NICOLASA4 FLORES-Y-AYALA.
2 CONT *2. ii. MARIA FLORES-Y-AYALA, b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. MIGUEL DE PERALTA-GUZMAN, September 13, 1698, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. Seville, Spain.
2 CONT **Marriage Notes for MARIA FLORES-Y-AYALA and MIGUEL DE PERALTA-GUZMAN:
2 CONT ***Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 166.
