2 CONT Spouse: Juan de FARIAS. Maria de TREVIÑO and Juan de FARIAS74 were married about 1575. Children were: Juliana de QUINTANILLA, Sebastiana Quintanilla TREVIÑO, Capt. Juan de FARIAS, 2nd Lt. Alonso de FARIAS, _______ TREVIÑO, Martin 
2 CONC SANCHEZ.
