2 CONT Maria de TREVIÑO RENTERIA (aka Maria RODRIGUEZ)688,895 was born circa 1665.2290 She was a natural daughter of Mayor de Renteria, meaning her parents were not married by the Catholic Church. The marriage investigation for Maria and
2 CONC  Francisco de Longoria noted that Maria was 16 years old at the time of the investigation on May 21, 1681, and that she was "español". She died before 1695 at the age of 30.688 Parents: Capt. Alonso de TREVIÑO de la Garza and Mari
2 CONC a Mayor de RENTERIA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Capt. Manuel PEREZ de OROPEZA. Maria de TREVIÑO RENTERIA (aka Maria RODRIGUEZ) and Capt. Manuel PEREZ de OROPEZA were married. Children were: Maria OROPEZA de Treviño, Juana de OROPEZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Francisco de LONGORIA Rodriguez. Maria de TREVIÑO RENTERIA (aka Maria RODRIGUEZ) and Francisco de LONGORIA Rodriguez were married after 31 May 1681
2 CONT
