1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Capt. Cristobal de VILLARREAL [3032] 
2 CONT *was born (date unknown). 
2 CONT *Rode with Alonso de Leon on his expeditions into Texas searching for the French colony founded by La Salle. 
2 CONT *Parents: Capt. Diego de VILLARREAL and Beatriz de las CASAS.
2 CONT *Spouse: Micaela de TREVIÑO (aka Micaela de Renteria). Micaela de TREVIÑO (aka Micaela de Renteria) and Capt. Cristobal de VILLARREAL were married on 25 June 1679.[420],[2762] 
2 CONT *Children were: 
2 CONT **1. Maria de VILLARREAL, 
2 CONT **2. Miguel de VILLARREAL.
2 CONT *Spouse: Ildefonsa (Aldonza) MARTINEZ Guajardo. Ildefonsa (Aldonza) MARTINEZ Guajardo and Capt. Cristobal de VILLARREAL were married after 17 June 1690.[152] 
2 CONT *Children were: 
2 CONT **1. Francisca Xaviera VILLARREAL, 
2 CONT **2. Antonio de VILLARREAL
2 CONT
