1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 388. MARIANA5 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-VILLARREAL (BLAS4 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-SEPULVEDA, FRANCISCO3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) 
2 CONT *was born 1717. 
2 CONT *She married LIEUTENANT JOSE-FRANCISCO-JOAQUIN ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-URRUTIA January 20, 1734/35 in Santiago Apostol, Monclova, Coahulia, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of ANTONIO DE ECAY-Y-MUZQUIZ-Y-URRUTIA and VICENTA VERA. He was born 1702 in Presidio del Sacramento, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for LIEUTENANT JOSE-FRANCISCO-JOAQUIN ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-URRUTIA: Commandant of San Antonio de Bexar Presidio at San Antonio, Texas
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIANA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-VILLARREAL and JOSE-FRANCISCO-JOAQUIN ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-URRUTIA are:
2 CONT *1. i. JAVIERA NASARIA6 ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. November 08, 1739, Santiago Apostol, Monclova, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. ii. MARIA-GUADALUPE-ANTONIA ECAY-MUZQUIZ-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. December 12, 1740, Santa Rosa de Lima, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahuila; 
2 CONT **m. JUAN-NEPONUCENO ALDERETE-RAMON, February 05, 1770, Santa Rosa de Lima, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1680, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. JOSEPH-ANTONIO ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. January 06, 1742, Santa Rosa de Lima, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahuila.
2 CONT *4. iv. LIEUTENANT BLAS-MARIA ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. May 04, 1744, Santa Rosa, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. JUANA-FRANCISCA URRUTIA-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, May 07, 1773, Santiago Apostol, Monclova, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1755.
2 CONT *5. v. MIGUEL FRANCISCO ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. October 15, 1745, Santa Rosa de Lima, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. MARIA-IGNACIA LONGORIA.
2 CONT *6. vi. LUCAS FRANCISCO ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. October 26, 1746, Santa Rosa de Lima, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. MARIA GERTUDIS ALDERETE-RIVERA, February 26, 1781, Santa Rosa de Lima, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1763.
2 CONT *7. vii. JOSEPH MARIA ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. March 17, 1748, Santa Rosa de Lima, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. viii. FRANCISCO XAVIER RUMA ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. February 19, 1750, Santa Rosa de Lima, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT *9. ix. MARIA GERTRUDIS LUZ ECAY-MUZQUIZ-Y-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. September 1752, Santa Rosa de Lima, Melchor Muzquiz, Coahulia, Mexico.
