1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This source says he had 2 wives 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) . He married (1) MARIA-JOSEFA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA 29 Aug  1707 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (2) JOSEFA DE  VILLARREAL-TREVINO 1722 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of  FRANCISCO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA and PHELIPA DE TREVINO-RENTERIA. She was  born 1700 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT  YET   it placeas all but one child   under the first wife - 
2 CONT
2 CONT I am going to break off  children with birth dates  afte 1722   and put under  the 2nd wife   
2 CONT
2 CONT I will place a a listing under  each wife of ASSUMED children then.
2 CONT
2 CONT 19 CAPTAIN MANUEL5 GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES (JOSEFA4  MORALES-DE-LAS-CASAS, MARIA3 DE-LAS-CASAS, JUAN-ALONSO2  LOBO-GUERRERO-FERNANDEZ-CORDOVA, JUAN1 LOBO-GUERRERO) was born 1682 in  Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died 2
2 CONC 9 Jul 1750 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo  Leon, Mexico. He married (1) MARIA-JOSEFA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA 29 Aug  1707 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JUAN DE VILLARREAL and LUISA DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA. S
2 CONC he was born 04 Apr 1684 in Boca de  Leones, Villaladama,Nuevo Leon,Mexico. He married (2) JOSEFA DE  VILLARREAL-TREVINO 1722 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of  FRANCISCO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA and PHELIPA DE TR
2 CONC EVINO-RENTERIA. She was  born 1700 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN MANUEL GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara,  by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 192 & 227. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MANUEL GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES and MARIA-JOSEFA DE  VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i. FRANCISCO-JAVIER6 GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. LUIS GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL. 
2 CONT
