1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Juan Antonio DE LA GARZA FALCON1151,1367,1419 was born (date unknown). I have concluded that Juan Antonio de la Garza's first two wives were both named Francisca de Villarreal. The two Francisca's were first cousin
2 CONC s. The first wife was the daughter of Juan Buatista de Villarreal and Luisa de la Garza; the second wife was the daughter of Juan de Villarreal and Juana Garcia de la Garza. My conclusions are based primarily on the marriage inves
2 CONC tigations noted as #23-16, #32-21, #35-10, #41-5, and #45-25 in "Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara" by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, and Baldomero Vela, Jr. Parents: Sgt. Major Francisco 
2 CONC DE LA GARZA FALCON and Leonor GARCIA DE SEPULVEDA (aka Leonor de Renteria).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Francisca de VILLARREAL. Francisca de VILLARREAL and Juan Antonio DE LA GARZA FALCON were married after 7 May 1707.1419 Children were: Maria Gertrudis DE LA GARZA, Antonia DE LA GARZA, Maria Teresa DE LA GARZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Francisca de VILLARREAL. Francisca de VILLARREAL and Juan Antonio DE LA GARZA FALCON were married before 1 July 1734. Children were: Maria Olaya DE LA GARZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Anna Josepha de PEÑA. Anna Josepha de PEÑA and Juan Antonio DE LA GARZA FALCON were married after 23 October 1751.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b58.html#P7468
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
