1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 59. MIGUEL4 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-MONTEMAYOR (LAZARIO3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ, BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born 1651 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He marrie
2 CONC d CLARA DE RENTERIA February 20, 1685 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of DIEGO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS and INES DE RENTERIA. She was born 1667 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CLARA DE RENTERIA:
2 CONT
2 CONT A.K.A. Clara de Villarreal.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MIGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-MONTEMAYOR and CLARA DE RENTERIA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 49.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MIGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-MONTEMAYOR and CLARA DE RENTERIA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MARIA5 DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. MARGARITA DE-LA-GARZA, b. August 10, 1686, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. DOMINGO GONZALEZ-VALDEZ, September 12, 1748, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 251. iii. DIEGO DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, b. October 08, 1699, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/garzafalcon.htm
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT 55. MIGUEL4 DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR (LAZARIO3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ, BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of MIGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR is:
2 CONT
2 CONT 239. i. MARIA5 DE-LA-GARZA.
2 CONT
