2 CONT Gral. Jose Salvador LOZANO DE-LA-GARZA 
2 CONT *was born in 1710. 
2 CONT *He died on 23 October 1777 at the age of 67 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *Asst Mayor of Monterrey (Listed as Alcalde of Monterrey after 1757, following Antonio Marcos de Cossio by Wikipedia)
2 CONT *Lieutenant Governor of N.L. 
2 CONT *Parents: Capt. Pedro LOZANO URQUIZU-3194 and Mariana DE LA GARZA ROCHA-3181.
2 CONT *Spouse: Maria Teresa GONZALEZ CABALLERO-5863. Maria Teresa GONZALEZ CABALLERO and Gral. Jose Salvador LOZANO DE-LA-GARZA were married on 12 February 1733. Children were: 
2 CONT **1. Juana Maria LOZANO GONZALEZ-5864, 
2 CONT **2. Jose Antonio LOZANO GONZALEZ-5865, 
2 CONT **3. Jose Miguel LOZANO GONZALEZ-5866, 
2 CONT **4. Jose Felix LOZANO GONZALEZ-5867, 
2 CONT **5. Jose Vicente LOZANO GONZALEZ-5868, 
2 CONT **6. Jose Santiago LOZANO GONZALEZ-5869, 
2 CONT **7. Maria Ignacia LOZANO GONZALEZ-5870.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria Petra GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5873. Children were: 
2 CONT **1. Maria Josefa LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5876, 
2 CONT **2. Maria Antonia LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5877, 
2 CONT **3. Maria Ines LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5878, 
2 CONT **4. Anastacia LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5879, 
2 CONT **5. Maria Petronila LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5880, 
2 CONT **6. Jose Martin LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5881, 
2 CONT **7. Padre Jose Mateo LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5882, 
2 CONT **8. Juan Jose LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5883, 
2 CONT **9. Maria de Jesus LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5884, 
2 CONT **10. Maria Leonor LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5885, 
2 CONT **11. Jose Fernando LOZANO GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-5886.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT From the English '''Wikipedia''' page on Higueras, Nuevo León:  ...  http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Higueras,_Nuevo_Le%C3%B3n  ...  "Diego de González died in 1728 and his son-in-law, captain José Salvador Lozano, married Doña María
2 CONC  Teresa González, and went on to construct the first chapel. The construction of a church was completed in 1854."
