2 CONC he was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died 1745.  '''He married (2) MARIA-MARGARITA DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-DE-LA-GARZA 08 Nov 1745 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of LAZARO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY-
2 CONC BERLANGA and ANA-MARIA DE-LA-GARZA-CAVAZOS. She was born 1724.'''
2 CONT
