2 CONT Maria Eugenia de los SANTOS932,1191 was born (date unknown). Marriage investigation #53-4, page 235, names her father as Lazaro de los Santos. This would be the Lazaro de los Santos who was married to Ana Gonzalez; however, I have
2 CONC  not determined if Ana was the mother of Maria Eugenia de los Santos.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Juan DE LA GARZA. Maria Eugenia de los SANTOS and Juan DE LA GARZA were married. Children were: Clara DE LA GARZA, Angela DE LA GARZA.
2 CONT
