1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 58. CAPTAIN JUAN5 GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA (MARIA4 DE-LA-GARZA, ELENA3 DE-LA-GARZA-RODRIGUEZ, PEDRO2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) 
2 CONT *was born 1670 in Coahuila, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died Aft. 05 Apr 1741 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) MARCELA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-VILLARREAL. 
2 CONT *He married (2) JUANA FLORES-DE-LA-CERDA 20 Sep 1694 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of BERNARDO FLORES-DE-ABREGO and JOSEFA FERNANDEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA. She was born 1680 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died Bef. 1741.
2 CONT ***Notes for CAPTAIN JUAN GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA: He signed his las will and testament on April 5, 1741. Source: Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey, by Lilia E. Villanueva de Cavazos. Page 122.
2 CONT ***Marriage Notes for JUAN GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA and JUANA FLORES-DE-LA-CERDA: Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 271.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA and MARCELA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-VILLARREAL are:
2 CONT *1. i. MANUEL-MARGIL6 GUERRA-CANAMAR-FLORES.
2 CONT *2. ii. ANA-JOAQUINA GUERRA-CANAMAR-FLORES.
2 CONT *3. iii. JUAN GUERRA-CANAMAR-FLORES.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN GUERRA-CANAMAR-DE-LA-GARZA and JUANA FLORES-DE-LA-CERDA are:
2 CONT *1. iv. DOMINGO6 GUERRA-FLORES, 
2 CONT **d. Died young.
2 CONT *2. 182. v. LUISA GUERRA-CANAMAR-Y-FLORES-DE-ABREGO, 
2 CONT **b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. vi. MARIA-JAVIERA GUERRA-FLORES-DE-ABREGO, 
2 CONT **b. 1695; 
2 CONT **m. JUAN-BAUTISTA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-VILLARREAL, 22 Feb 1725, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1690.
2 CONT ****Notes for JUAN-BAUTISTA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-VILLARREAL: No issue
2 CONT *4. 183. vii. MARIA-JOSEFA GUERRA-FLORES, 
2 CONT **b. 07 Jun 1697, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. 184. viii. PEDRO-DE-ALCANTARA GUERRA-FLORES, 
2 CONT **b. 1700, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. ix. FRANCISCO JAVIER GUERRA-FLORES, 
2 CONT **b. 18 Mar 1701, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. x. ANA-MARIA-JACINTA GUERRA-FLORES, 
2 CONT **b. 28 Aug 1708, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. xi. JUAN-JOSEPH GUERRA-FLORES, 
2 CONT **b. 1713, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (1) MARIA JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA; 
2 CONT **m. (2) ANA-GERTRUDIS DE IGLESIAS-Y-SANTA-CRUZ, 27 May 1732, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1714.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for JUAN-JOSEPH GUERRA-FLORES and ANA-GERTRUDIS DE IGLESIAS-Y-SANTA-CRUZ: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 29
2 CONC 3.
2 CONT *9. 185. xii. JOSEPH-ANTONIO GUERRA-FLORES, 
2 CONT **b. 10 Apr 1715, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *10. xiii. IGNACIO GUERRA-FLORES, 
2 CONT **b. 17 Jan 1717, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *11. 186. xiv. JOSEPH-BERNARDO GUERRA-FLORES, 
2 CONT **b. 1724, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *12. 187. xv. CLARA-MARIA GUERRA-FLORES-DE-ABREGO, 
2 CONT **b. 1729, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Died young.
2 CONT
