1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ISABEL2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO (JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) was born 1606, and died July 25, 1693 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married CAPTAIN FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-LOPEZ Abt. September 162
2 CONC 6, son of GONZALO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES and MARTHA LOPEZ. He was born 1594 in Orotaba, Isle of Tenerife, Canary Islands, and died 1666 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-LOPEZ:
2 CONT
2 CONT In New Spain, he discovered the mines of Salinas and of San Nicolas de Tolentino.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1624, he held the post of Chief Constable of Monterrey. In 1626, he was alderman and a year later he held the position of councilman and procurator of Monterrey. In 1664, at 53 years of age, he was appointed mayor of Salinas Vi
2 CONC ctoria by Governor Martin de Zavala. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ISABEL MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO and FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-LOPEZ:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:The Conquistadores and Crypto-Jews of Monterrey, by David T. Raphael.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ISABEL MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO and FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-LOPEZ are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 23. i. LAZARO3 DE BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. ANTONIA DE BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ, m. DIEGO SAENZ, September 09, 1676, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. JOSE BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES, m. MARIA-DE-JESUS BENAVIDES.
2 CONT
2 CONT 24. iv. ANA-ISABEL MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO.
2 CONT
2 CONT 25. v. MARIA DE BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT 26. vi. ANA-MARIA BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-MARTINEZ, b. Abt. 1627; d. June 07, 1677, Agualeguas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 27. vii. CAPTAIN FRANCISCO BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ, b. 1629, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. July 1705, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 28. viii. LUISA DE BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ-GUAGARDO, b. 1640, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; d. Bef. 1672, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 29. ix. JUAN BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-Y-MARTINEZ, b. 1645.
2 CONT
