1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 3. CAPTAIN IGNACIO2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO (JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) 
2 CONT *was born in Santiago del Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA-ISABEL FLORES-DE-VALDEZ 1640 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, daughter of NICOLAS FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR and MARIA DE ABREGO. 
2 CONT
