1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria Isabel de Trevino SALAZAR (aka Maria de Treviño)422,872,955,1079,2884 was also known as ______ Flores or Valle. Ana de Valle and Juan Flores were siblings, but I do not know whether their father was a Flores 
2 CONC and their mother a Valle, or vice versa. Parents: Pedro (Juan?) de SALAZAR and Isabel de TREVIÑO (aka Isabel de Quintanilla).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Capt. Rodrigo FLORES de Valdes. Maria Isabel de Trevino SALAZAR (aka Maria de Treviño) and Capt. Rodrigo FLORES de Valdes were married in 1612.872 They872 were married. Children were: Alferez Rodrigo FLORES de Valdes, Isab
2 CONC el FLORES de VALDES, Maria FLORES de Valdes (aka Maria de Salazar), Diego FLORES de VALDES, Yldefonsa (Aldonsa) FLORES de VALDES, Luisa FLORES de VALDES (aka Luisa de Valle), Alvaro FLORES, Miguel FLORES de Valdes, Pedro FLORES de
2 CONC  VALDES, Francisca FLORES de Valdes (aka Francisca de Valle), Maria Juana FLORES de Valdes, Juan FLORES, Ana de VALLE (OVALLE).
2 CONT
