2 CONT ====================
2 CONT 3. MARIA-ISABEL2 DE SALAZAR-Y-TREVINO (PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR) was born 1600 in Mexico City, D.F., Mexico. She married CAPTAIN RODRIGO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-CARBALLO2, son of JUAN-ALVARO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ and ALDONSA-ALFONSA CARBALLO. He was
2 CONC  born 1585 in Villa de Cangas de Tineo, Asturias, Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARIA-ISABEL DE SALAZAR-Y-TREVINO: A.K.A. Maria Isabel de Trevino. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIA-ISABEL DE SALAZAR-Y-TREVINO and RODRIGO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-CARBALLO are:
2 CONT * 12. i. ISABEL3 FLORES-DE-VALDEZ.
2 CONT * 13. ii. ALVARO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR, d. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT * 14. iii. DIEGO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT * 15. iv. FRANCISCA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT * 16. v. JUAN FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR.
2 CONT * 17. vi. LUISA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR.
2 CONT * 18. vii. MIGUEL FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR.
2 CONT * 19. viii. NICOLAS FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR.
2 CONT * 20. ix. RODRIGO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR, b. Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; d. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT * 21. x. YLDEFONSA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR, b. 1612.
2 CONT * 22. xi. JUAN-MIGUEL FLORES-DE-VALDEZ.
2 CONT
