2 CONT *Spouse: Maria Isabel de Trevino SALAZAR (aka Maria de Treviño). Maria Isabel de Trevino SALAZAR (aka Maria de Treviño) and Capt. Rodrigo FLORES de Valdes were married in 1612.[872]  Children were: 
2 CONT **1. Alferez Rodrigo FLORES de Valdes, 
2 CONT **2. Isabel FLORES de VALDES, 
