1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 35. MICAELA4 GUERRA-CANAMAR-MORALES (LEONOR3 DE MORALES, JUANA2 DE TREVINO-QUINTANILLA-Y-SALAZAR, PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR) 
2 CONT *was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married SERGEANT MAJOR NICOLAS GUAJARDO, 
2 CONT **son of LORENZO MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO and YLDEFONSA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-SALAZAR. He was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for SERGEANT MAJOR NICOLAS GUAJARDO: Source: Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coagulia y Nuevo Leon, Saltillo Tomo II by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 104.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MICAELA GUERRA-CANAMAR-MORALES and NICOLAS GUAJARDO are:
2 CONT *1. i. NICOLAS5 GUAJARDO-GUERRA.
2 CONT *2. ii. JOSEPH GUAJARDO-GUERRA.
2 CONT *3. iii. ANA-MARIA GUAJARDO-GUERRA, 
2 CONT **m. (1) JUAN FERNANDEZ; 
2 CONT **m. (2) JUAN DE NORIEGA, 19 Feb 1725/26, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Durango, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for ANA-MARIA GUAJARDO-GUERRA and JUAN DE NORIEGA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 244. [54-5].
2 CONT *4. iv. JUAN GUAJARDO-GUERRA, 
2 CONT *b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT *m. (1) PETRONILA BADELLO; 
2 CONT *m. (2) MARIA-ROSA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ; 
2 CONT **b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. v. ANTONIO GUAJARDO-GUERRA.
2 CONT *6. vi. SERGEANT MAJOR PEDRO-MARIA MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO, 
2 CONT **b. 1677; 
2 CONT **d. 02 Jan 1719/20, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. MARIA BAEZ-DE-TREVINO, 06 Oct 1697, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico6; 
2 CONT ***b. 1680; 
2 CONT ***d. 07 May 1759, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Notes for MARIA BAEZ-DE-TREVINO: A,K,A, Maria de Amaya y Trevino.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for PEDRO-MARIA MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO and MARIA BAEZ-DE-TREVINO: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 189. [44-7].
2 CONT *7. vii. RAMONA-ALDONZA MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-GUERRA, 
2 CONT **b. 1687; 
2 CONT **m. JOSEPH-ANTONIO DE ECA-Y-MUZQUIZ-Y-URRUTIA; 
2 CONT ***b. Abt. 1685, Monclova, Coahulia, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***d. 1738, San Juan Bautista, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Notes for JOSEPH-ANTONIO DE ECA-Y-MUZQUIZ-Y-URRUTIA: In 1708 - 1712, he served as Governor of Coahuila. Source:The Handbook on Texas Online.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/salazar.htm
2 CONT --------------------
