2 CONT He wrote the book titled "Historia de Nuevo Leon". Source:GallantOurcasts, Texas Trumoil 15191734, by Ben Cuellar Ximenes. Texas andNortheastern Mexico, 1630-1690 by Juan Bautista Chapa. _CRE DATE 30 SEP 2016 TIME 13:28:00
