1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Spouse: Maria Francisca DE LA GARZA. Maria Francisca DE LA GARZA and Joseph Ignacio TREVINO were married after 6 December 1754.1227 This was the second marriage investigation involving Joseph Ignacio Trevino, the f
2 CONC irst having occured on August 16, 1751, for his proposed marriage to Maria Rita Garcia. This second marriage investigation makes no note of Joseph Ignacio Trevino being a widower, implying that his first proposed marriage to Maria
2 CONC  Rita Garcia never took place. If that marriage did take place, then Maria Rita Garcia died within three years of their marriage.
