2 CONT Luisa de OCHOA [2599] 
2 CONT *was born (date unknown). Parents: Capt. Nicolas de OCHOA de Elejalde (del Ejalde) and Isabel DE LA GARZA (aka Isabel Gonzalez).
2 CONT *Spouse: Joseph PEREZ DE ESCAMILLA (aka Joseph de Escamilla). Luisa de OCHOA and Joseph PEREZ DE ESCAMILLA (aka Joseph de Escamilla) were married on 10 April 1684.[492] Children were: **1. Juana de ESCAMILLA, 
2 CONT **2. Francisco de ESCAMILLA, 
2 CONT **3. Joseph Antonio de ESCAMILLA.
2 CONT
