1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nicolas was the municipal president of Monterrey, New Spain in 1660, 1671, 1675 and 1687. He was a resident of the Hacienda de San Agustin, middle of Guadalupe in 1658.
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Nicolas de OCHOA de Elejalde (del Ejalde) [16],[398],[2600] was born (date unknown).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Isabel DE LA GARZA (aka Isabel Gonzalez). Isabel DE LA GARZA (aka Isabel Gonzalez) and Capt. Nicolas de OCHOA de Elejalde (del Ejalde) were married. Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Blas de OCHOA de Lexalde (del Ejalde), 
2 CONT *2. Capt. Joseph OCHOA de Elejalde (del Ejalde), 
2 CONT *3. Isabel de OCHOA, 
2 CONT *4. Luisa de OCHOA, 
2 CONT *5. Alferez Nicolas OCHOA de Elejalde (del Ejalde), 
2 CONT *6. Maria de OCHOA
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b166.html#P3727
2 CONT
2 CONT ================================
2 CONT
2 CONT Captain Nicolas Ochoa De Elejalde 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1626, and died 13 Feb 1688 in Hidalgo,Tamalulipas,Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) Isabel De La Garza. 
2 CONT *He married (2) Isabel De La Garza, 
2 CONT **daughter of Blas Maria De La Garza Falcon and Beatriz Gonzalez Hidalgo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Captain Nicolas Ochoa De Elejalde and Isabel De La Garza are: 
2 CONT *1. Captain Blas De Ochoa, 
2 CONT **d. date unknown.
2 CONT
