2 CONT Captain Blas De Ochoa (son of Captain Nicolas Ochoa De Elejalde and Isabel De La Garza) died date unknown. He married Antonia Lozano on 18 Aug 1693, daughter of Captain Pedro Lozano and Mariana De La Garza Falcon.
2 CONT
