1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 118. CAPTAIN BLAS6 DE-LA-GARZA-LOPEZ-PRIETO (BLAS5 DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, MARIA-MARGARITA4 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) 
2 CONT *was born 1692 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA-MAGDALENA GARCIA-DAVILA 30 Oct 1712 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of PEDRO GARCIA-DAVILA and ANGELA MENDEZ-DE-TOVAR-HIDALGO. She was born 1692 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-LOPEZ-PRIETO and MARIA-MAGDALENA GARCIA-DAVILA are:
2 CONT *1. i. IGNACIO-BALTASAR7 DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA, b. 01 Feb 1718, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. ii. ANGELA DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA, b. 1720, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. IGNACIO GUERRA-CANAMAR, 26 Sep 1738, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1718, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT **Marriage Notes for ANGELA DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA and IGNACIO GUERRA-CANAMAR: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 103.
2 CONT *3. 343. iii. LEONOR-JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA, b. 07 Feb 1723, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. 344. iv. JUAN-JOSEPH DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA, b. 1725; d. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. v. ANA-JOSEPHA DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA, b. 1726, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. JOSEPH-CAYETANO DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ, 17 Jul 1746, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1726, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT **Marriage Notes for ANA-JOSEPHA DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA and JOSEPH-CAYETANO DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 1
2 CONC 14.
2 CONT *6. 345. vi. JOSEPH-BUENAVENTURA DE-LA-GARZA-GARCIA, b. 1740.
2 CONT
