1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 205. ASCENCIO6 CUELLAR-GUAJARDO (MARIA5 GUAJARDO-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, ISABEL4 GARCIA-DEL-VALLE, PEDRO3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) was born in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico,
2 CONC  and died Abt. 1705 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. He married ANA GARCIA-TREVINO July 04, 1694 in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, daughter of MATEO GARCIA-DE-LA-GARZA and LUCIA DE TREVINO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY. She was born 1676.
2 CONT
