1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Isabel de ARISPE 95 was born (date unknown). Marriage investigation #11-7 notes that she was the daughter of Juan de Arispe but does not give the name of her mother. It seems reasonable to assume she was a legitima
2 CONC te daughter and her mother was Ana de Lisarraras y Cuellar. Parents: Capt. Juan de ARISPE and Ana de Lisarraras y CUELLAR (aka Ana de Cuellar).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Capt. Martin SANCHEZ Navarro. Isabel de ARISPE and Capt. Martin SANCHEZ Navarro were married.351 Children were: Pedro Joseph SANCHEZ de Navarro, Cristobal Joseph SANCHEZ Navarro.
