1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 206. MARIA6 DE CUELLAR-GUAJARDO (MARIA5 GUAJARDO-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, ISABEL4 GARCIA-DEL-VALLE, PEDRO3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) was born in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONC  She married CAPTAIN ALONSO DE-LA-PENA-LOPEZ Abt. 1690, son of ALONSO-MARTIN DE-LA-PENA and MARIA LOPEZ-DE-LA-CUEVA-RUELAS. He was born in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, and died Aft. November 14, 1691.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MARIA DE CUELLAR-GUAJARDO and ALONSO DE-LA-PENA-LOPEZ: Mil Familia III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 291.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIA DE CUELLAR-GUAJARDO and ALONSO DE-LA-PENA-LOPEZ are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MARIA7 DE-LA-PENA-CUELLAR, m. MIGUEL VALDEZ, April 15, 1719, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; b. Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MARIA DE-LA-PENA-CUELLAR and MIGUEL VALDEZ: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 284.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. ISABEL MARTINEZ, m. NICOLAS RAMON.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. MICHAELA DE-LA-PENA-CUELLAR, m. BERNARDO FLORES-DE-ABREGO.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. JUANA DE-LA-PENA-CUELLAR.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. JULIANA DE-LA-PENA-CUELLAR.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. CAPTAIN MARTIN DE-LA-PENA-CUELLAR, b. 1680, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; m. (1) MICAELA GARCIA-TREVINO, February 25, 1706/07, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; b. Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; m. (2) LUCIA DE BENAVIDES-Y-MAYA, Septembe
2 CONC r 15, 1717, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; b. 1684.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN MARTIN DE-LA-PENA-CUELLAR:
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara. Page 197
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for LUCIA DE BENAVIDES-Y-MAYA:
2 CONT
2 CONT A.K.A. Lucia de Trevino. Source:Origin of the surnames Garza and Trevino in Nuevo Leon by Tomas Mendirichaga Cueva. Page 24.
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. JACINTA DE-LA-PENA-CUELLAR, b. 1692, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; m. LAZARO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, March 29, 1709, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; b. 1690, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for LAZARO FLORES-DE-VALDEZ: :Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese
