1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alferez Antonio de ZEPEDA1681,1703 was born (date unknown). Marriage investigation #53-8 notes that he was the son of Alonso de Zepeda but does not give the name of his mother. It seems reasonable to assume he was 
2 CONC a legitimate son and his mother was Bernarda de Herrera. Parents: Alonso de ZEPEDA and Bernarda de HERRERA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Isabel GARCIA. Isabel GARCIA and Alferez Antonio de ZEPEDA were married. Children were: Joseph de ZEPEDA, Joaquin de ZEPEDA, Bernarda de ZEPEDA, Juan Cayetano de ZEPEDA, Margarita de ZEPEDA, Josepha de ZEPEDA Cavallero, Ma
2 CONC ria de ZEPEDA, Isabel de ZEPEDA.
2 CONT
