2 CONC  Coahuila, Mexico. He married CECILIA XIMENEZ-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, daughter of BARTOLOME XIMENEZ-NAVARRO and JOSEPHA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-ABREGO. 
