2 CONT 79. JUAN5 DE TREVINO-CALIZ (LUISA4 DE CALIZ-FLORES, JUAN3 DE CALIS-COY, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) was born 1675. He married (1) LUISA FLORES. She was born in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico. He married (2) GERONIMA G
2 CONC UAJARDO-DE-LA-GARZA July 30, 1700 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JOSEPH MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO and NICOLASA DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-ROCHA. She was born 1675.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for JUAN DE TREVINO-CALIZ and GERONIMA GUAJARDO-DE-LA-GARZA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 189.
2 CONT
