2 CONC IGUEZ-CASTANO-SOSA Abt. 1602 in New Mexico, daughter of Don JUAN NAVARRO and Dona MARIA RODRIGUEZ-DE-SOSA. She was born Abt. 1575, and died Dec 1674 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Notes for CAPTAIN BERNABE DE-LAS-CASAS: In 1598
