2 CONC otes for MARIA-BEATRIZ NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ-CASTANO-SOSA: A.K.A. Beatriz de Navarro. Her first marriage was to Captain Alonso de Sosa Albornoz (Murdered in New Mexico). A daughter from this marriage was Dona Maria-Ana de Sosa Alborno
2 CONC z Navarro who married General Alonso de Farias Trevino. Source: New Mexico's First Colonists, compiled and arranged by David H. Snow.
