1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Josefa de MORALES [663],[885],[1230] was born (date unknown). 
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Marriage Investiation #7-10, page 36 (January 4, 1692; the prospective marriage of Benito Gutierres to Maria Rosa de la Garza), Josefa de Morales had an illicit affair with the prospective groom Benito Gutierres. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Luis de MORALES and Maria LOBO GUERRERO (aka Maria de las Casas).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Manuel GONZALES de Paredes. Josefa de MORALES and Manuel GONZALES de Paredes were married. Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Luis GONZALES de Paredes, 
2 CONT *2. Capt. Juan GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT *3. Joseph GONZALES de PAREDES, 
2 CONT *4. Alferez Manuel GONZALES de Paredes
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b163.html#P7434
2 CONT
2 CONT =========================
2 CONT
2 CONT 37. JOSEFA4 MORALES-DE-LAS-CASAS (LUIS3 DE MORALES, JUANA2 DE TREVINO-QUINTANILLA-Y-SALAZAR, PEDRO1 DE SALAZAR) 
2 CONT *was born 1652, and 
2 CONT *died in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN MANUEL GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY Bef. 1690, 
2 CONT **son of JUAN GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-DE-LOS-SANTOS and MARIA DE OLEA-CAMACHO. He was born 1650 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died Aft. 1721 in Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT **Notes for JOSEFA MORALES-DE-LAS-CASAS: A.K.A. Josefa de Morales.
2 CONT ***Notes for CAPTAIN MANUEL GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY: Source:Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 46.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSEFA MORALES-DE-LAS-CASAS and MANUEL GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY are:
2 CONT *1. i. PEDRO5 GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES, 
2 CONT **m. LEONOR-JAVIERA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON; 
2 CONT ***b. Abt. 1703.
2 CONT *2. ii. JUAN BAUTISTA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES.
2 CONT *3. iii. JUAN MARCOS GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES.
2 CONT *4. iv. JOSEFA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES.
2 CONT *5. v. MARIANA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES.
2 CONT *6. vi. CAPTAIN MANUEL GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES, 
2 CONT **b. 1682, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. 29 Jul 1750, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (1) MARIA-JOSEFA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, 29 Aug 1707, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 04 Apr 1684, Boca de Leones, Villaladama,Nuevo Leon,Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (2) JOSEFA DE VILLARREAL-TREVINO, 1722, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1700, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Notes for CAPTAIN MANUEL GONZALEZ-AMAYA-DE-PAREDES-MORALES: Source: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 192 & 227.
2 CONT *7. vii. LUIS GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES, 
2 CONT **b. 1688; 
2 CONT **m. MARIA RITA VILLARREAL-CORTINAS, 29 Sep 1710, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1690.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for LUIS GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES and MARIA VILLARREAL-CORTINAS: Marriage source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, J
2 CONC r. Page 214.
2 CONT *8. viii. JOSEPH GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES, 
2 CONT **b. 1690, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. FRANCISCA-JAVIERA DE VILLARREAL, 30 Jul 1712; 
2 CONT ***b. 1692, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Notes for JOSEPH GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES: Source: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 221
2 CONT *9. ix. JOAN GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES, 
2 CONT **b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. PETRONILA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, 07 May 1707, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Notes for JOAN GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-MORALES: Source: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 201 A.K.A. Juan Gonzalez
2 CONT
