1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 20. FRANCISCO-JAVIER5 DE URIBE (PHELIPE4 DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, ANTONIO3 URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, JOSE2 URIBE-Y-VERGARA-TOVAR, PEDRO1 URIBE-Y-VERGARA) was born 1708 in Carrizal. Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died
2 CONC  October 01, 1769 in Revilla, Tamaulipas, Mexico. He married (1) EUSTACIA CABALLERO. He married (2) MARIA-APOLONIA BERMUDEZ-DE-TREVINO May 10, 1729 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JOSEPH DE BE
2 CONC RMUDEZ and BERNARDA TREVINO-RENTERIA. She died April 01, 1772 in Revilla, Tamaulipas, Mexico. He married (3) MARIA VILLARREAL-TREVINO 1745.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for FRANCISCO-JAVIER DE URIBE:
2 CONT
2 CONT He is listed on the 1753 census, Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT He, his wife and children are listed on the 1757 census, Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for FRANCISCO-JAVIER DE URIBE and MARIA-APOLONIA BERMUDEZ-DE-TREVINO:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to Marriages Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr.,
2 CONT
2 CONT Badine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 77.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANCISCO-JAVIER DE URIBE and MARIA-APOLONIA BERMUDEZ-DE-TREVINO are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 47. i. MARIA NICOLASA6 DE URIBE, b. July 30, 1730, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. MARIA ESTEFANA GUADALUPE DE URIBE, b. March 07, 1733, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 48. iii. JOSE-LUIS-FRANCISCO DE URIBE, b. July 30, 1735, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Bef. 1791.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. JOSEPHA RAMONA DE URIBE, b. October 24, 1737, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. GERBACIO VADILLO-RODRIGUEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT 49. v. MARIA-JUSTA-PHELIPA DE URIBE, b. September 02, 1739, Nuestra Sra, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 50. vi. MARIA-APOLINARIA DE URIBE, b. August 28, 1741, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 51. vii. ROSA-MARIA-DE-CARMEN DE URIBE, b. August 19, 1745, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
