2 CONT Notes for Captain Nicolas de la Garza:
2 CONT (30-7,30-17, 116-7 IMIDG; 443Protocolo) Testamento de Beatriz Garcia names daughter Maria de Trevino, married to Nicolas de la Garza, as an heir and also names Nicolas as an executor of her Will (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Maria de Trevino:
2 CONT 53-20 pg 239 "Marriage Investigations--Guadalajara" show that Maria de Trevino's mother is a "Maria", a sister of Margarita Saldivar de Sosa; Margarita's sister is recorded as Maria de Saldivar, wife of Bernardo Garcia (317-18-Pob
2 CONC ladores de Monterrey by Garmendia Leal & pgs 29 & 38-Reseacher PT Rodriguez InterNet) ; the analysis, however, appears to to be in error because  Protocolo no. 443-Cavazos, Testament of Beatriz Garcia,  shows that Maria de Trevino
2 CONC 's parents to be Beatriz Garcia and Jose de Trevino. (JMB)  
2 CONT
