1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cristobal Gonzalez y Ochoa was Alcalde ordinario of Monterrey, Nuevo Leon in 1701.  He lived in Guadalupe, N.L. a small community outside of Monterrey and was the owner of present day Guadalupe N.L.(Rancho Guadalup
2 CONC e?)  This property he inherited from his fatherAndres and/or bought from his brothers and sisters.
2 CONT
2 CONT   He was regidor de Monterrey in early 1707.
