1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Capt. Gonzalo FERNANDEZ de Castro376,688,872,1322,1591 was born about 1598.1592 According to the 1626 Census of the Villa de Cerralvo (Monterrey), Gonzalo Fernandez de Castro lived 7 leagues from the Villa. Two sin
2 CONC gle Spanish soldiers, Juan de Olivares and Alonso Carrasco, lived with him. Parents: Juan FERNANDEZ de Castro and Mayor de RENTERIA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria RODRIGUEZ. Children were: Maria Mayor de RENTERIA, Clara de RENTERIA (aka Clara Fernandez de Castro), Diego FERNANDEZ DE CASTRO.
