2 CONT Owner of the Hacienda de Pesqueria Chica, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.&nbsp; In1633, he was a Captain operating out of Monterrey.&nbsp; In 1633, he wasthe Alcalde for the city. And in 1642 he the Mayor of Monterrey andCaptain of the armed 
2 CONC forces. See With All Arms - A Study of KindredGroup, by Carl Laurence Duaine. _CRE DATE 30 SEP 2016 TIME 13:28:00
